## Intuition
reverse traversal from rightmost element so that multiple loops no need to run

## Approach
since right most element is already a leader, we can make current leader as a base and travel left to compare with leader. if any left element is greater than current leader then make that new leader and append the vector with that leader and continue traverse left untill reach left most element.

## Solution
```cpp[]
class Solution {
public:
    vector<int> leaders(vector<int>& nums) {
        if(nums.empty()){
            return {};
        }
        vector<int> result;
        int n = nums.size();
        result.reserve(n);
        int maxright = nums[n-1];
        result.push_back(maxright);
        for(int i=n-2; i>=0; --i){
            if(nums[i]>maxright){
                result.push_back(nums[i]);
                maxright = nums[i];
            }
        }
        reverse(result.begin(), result.end());
        return result;
    }
};
```

